    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jigsaw Chronicles: Haunted Tales takes you on a journey across the globe, where puzzles reveal eerie folklore and haunted legends from four distinct continents. With 20 unique images and meticilously written stories, this game introduces you to the mysterious and supernatural tales that have shaped cultures throughout history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Four Haunted Categories: Explore the continents and discover folklore filled with haunted stories and chilling characters. Each region brings five unique puzzles and their own tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique Stories: Each puzzle unlocks a unique narrative, bringing the folklore behind the image to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Free Play Mode: Replay each puzzle with customizable difficulty\u2014choose from easy, medium, or hard by adjusting the piece count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enhanced Gameplay: Enjoy immersive puzzle-solving with haptic feedback and controller sound effects, adding a new dimension to the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Epic Visuals &amp; Soundtrack: Enjoy high-resolution art and a hauntingly atmospheric soundtrack that complements the theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jigsaw Chronicles: Haunted Tales takes you on a journey across the globe, where puzzles reveal eerie folklore and haunted legends from four distinct continents. With 20 unique images and meticilously written stories, this game introduces you to the mysterious and supernatural tales that have shaped cultures throughout history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Four Haunted Categories: Explore the continents and discover folklore filled with haunted stories and chilling characters. Each region brings five unique puzzles and their own tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique Stories: Each puzzle unlocks a unique narrative, bringing the folklore behind the image to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Free Play Mode: Replay each puzzle with customizable difficulty\u2014choose from easy, medium, or hard by adjusting the piece count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enhanced Gameplay: Enjoy immersive puzzle-solving with haptic feedback and controller sound effects, adding a new dimension to the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Epic Visuals &amp; Soundtrack: Enjoy high-resolution art and a hauntingly atmospheric soundtrack that complements the theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
